# ShortsPilot AI — environment template
# Copy this file to .env and adjust if needed:
#   cp .env.example .env

# ================================================================
#  IMPORTANT: ALL API KEYS (Gemini, Google OAuth, YouTube, Razorpay,
#  PayPal) are configured in the ADMIN PANEL — /admin -> API &
#  Integrations and Payments. They are stored AES-256-GCM encrypted
#  at rest. There is NO .env fallback for API keys by design:
#  the admin panel is the single source of truth.
# ================================================================

# SQLite database location. NOTE: the path is resolved relative to the
# prisma/ folder (where schema.prisma lives), so "../db/custom.db" points at
# the project's db/custom.db — the pre-configured database shipped in the zip
# (admin account, plans, your admin-panel keys). File is created by
# `npx prisma db push` + `npm run db:seed` when cloning from git instead.
DATABASE_URL="file:../db/custom.db"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Dev server (LAN access) — binds 0.0.0.0 and auto-allowlists LAN IPs.
# Override only if needed:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# DEV_HOST=0.0.0.0            # localhost to restrict
# DEV_ORIGINS=10.23.61.226    # extra comma-separated origins allowed to load dev assets
# DEV_PORT=3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Infrastructure secrets (NOT provider API keys — leave defaults
# for local dev; set strong values only in production):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SP_ENCRYPTION_KEY=          # AES key for encrypting admin-stored credentials
# SP_SESSION_SECRET=          # session token signing secret

# Where to get each key (free tiers) — then paste them in /admin:
# - Gemini LLM (ideas/scripts/support assistant): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   -> /admin -> API & Integrations -> "AI provider — Gemini fallback"
# - Google OAuth (Google sign-in + YouTube channel connect): https://console.cloud.google.com
#   -> /admin -> API & Integrations -> "Google OAuth 2.0 client"
# - YouTube Data API key (optional @handle read-only mode): same console
#   -> /admin -> API & Integrations -> "YouTube Data API key"
# - Razorpay INR test keys: https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys
#   -> /admin -> Payments -> Razorpay
# - PayPal USD sandbox keys: https://developer.paypal.com/dashboard/applications
#   -> /admin -> Payments -> PayPal

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Production (Docker / Render / VPS) — set by the Dockerfile already:
#   DATABASE_URL=file:/data/db/app.db   UPLOAD_DIR=/data/uploads
# UPLOAD_DIR must point to a PERSISTENT disk. SP_ENCRYPTION_KEY: set once, never change.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# UPLOAD_DIR=
